      "reason": "The review specifies the age-based groups used for synthesis to assess the effect of age on treatment outcomes."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Studies were excluded if they focused exclusively on complicated pediatric populations, such as those with comorbidities that could independently affect post-operative outcomes.",
      "reason": "The review provides a clear rationale for excluding studies focused on complicated pediatric populations, noting that these comorbidities could independently affect post-operative outcomes."
    }
